4
00:00:17.708 --> 00:00:20.583
{\an8}<i>Here. look at you. I'll film this.</i>

5
00:00:22.125 --> 00:00:24.166
{\an8}<i>Just say hi over here.</i>

6
00:00:24.250 --> 00:00:26.958
{\an8}- <i>I don't know how to do this.</i>
<i>- You don't know. honey?</i>

7
00:00:29.458 --> 00:00:33.000
