13
00:02:17.041 --> 00:02:19.291
Mommy's always here.

14
00:02:32.041 --> 00:02:34.958
There are things in this life
you'll understand with time.

15
00:02:38.416 --> 00:02:40.625
Other things you'll learn from me.

16
