92
00:08:45.125 --> 00:08:46.583
You like it?

93
00:08:47.208 --> 00:08:48.208
Yes.

94
00:08:48.291 --> 00:08:49.875
It's yours.

95
00:09:03.500 --> 00:09:05.291
