I love you. you know?

114
00:10:21.666 --> 00:10:22.708
Same here.

115
00:10:26.541 --> 00:10:28.458
Snooze you lose. Blondie.

116
00:10:28.958 --> 00:10:31.666
But don't worry.
You'll get it. It will happen.

117
00:10:32.541 --> 00:10:33.500
Come. Blondie.

118
00:10:35.166 --> 00:10:37.208
I've never met a woman like her.

119
00:10:38.500 --> 00:10:39.625
Marcos…

120
