149
00:13:40.166 --> 00:13:42.750
I kind of feel like we've crossed paths.

150
00:13:43.875 --> 00:13:46.291
Your face looks familiar. you know?

151
00:13:46.375 --> 00:13:47.833
Hmm.

152
00:13:47.916 --> 00:13:49.958
Where did you work. Elize? I'm curious.

153
00:13:50.041 --> 00:13:51.166
What's this?

154
00:13:51.958 --> 00:13:53.750
