- Thank you. man.

159
00:14:15.250 --> 00:14:17.750
Hey. Blondie. How's it going?

160
00:14:18.916 --> 00:14:20.291
Almost there.

161
00:14:24.708 --> 00:14:26.250
Marcos. look.

162
